ru believed that Communalism would be dangerous for India.) as correct under Reading Comprehension.,Hard,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2016 Tier 1 (2016-08-29 Shift 1 (Morning)),https://sscportal.in/cgl/tier-1/papers/english-comprehension-29-aug-2016-morning-shift
