ght fail in the examinations,That he might be made a prisoner,B,That his parents would die suddenly at night,Official SSC CGL 2016 Tier 1 archived key identifies Option B (That his parents would die suddenly at night) as correct under Reading Comprehension.,Hard,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2016 Tier 1 (2016-09-03 Shift 3 (Evening)),https://sscportal.in/cgl/tier-1/papers/english-comprehension-3-sep-2016-evening-shift
