he species 'homo sapiens' does not become extinct. The energy sources of the future are",nuclear and hydro power,coal and natural gas,wind and solar power,oil and biomass,C,wind and solar power,Official SSC CGL 2016 Tier 1 archived key identifies Option C (wind and solar power) as correct under Reading Comprehension.,Hard,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2016 Tier 1 (2016-09-10 Shift 3 (Evening)),https://sscportal.in/cgl/tier-1/papers/english-comprehension-10-sep-2016-evening-shift
