ir interest.,Every person would have a reason to lead.,C,Many would develop leadership in the field of their interest.,Official SSC CGL 2016 Tier 2 archived key identifies Option C (Many would develop leadership in the field of their interest.) as correct under Reading Comprehension.,Hard,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2016 Tier 2 (2016-12-01 Shift 3 (Evening)),https://sscportal.in/cgl/tier-2/papers/english-language-comprehension-1-dec-2016-evening-shift
