re. Government College of Arts and Crafts shifted to which place during the tenure of Robert Chisholm?",Nilgiri Hills,Popham’s Broadway,Poonamallee High Road,Government quarters,C,Poonamallee High Road,Official SSC CGL 2017 Tier 2 archived key identifies Option C (Poonamallee High Road) as correct under Reading Comprehension.,Hard,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2017 Tier 2 (2018-02-19 Shift 2 (Afternoon)),https://sscportal.in/cgl/tier-2/papers/english-language-and-comprehension-19-feb-2018
