ning a blind eye when hawkers face extortion,Encroaching public spaces,Not promoting small scale industries,C,Encroaching public spaces,Official SSC CGL 2017 Tier 2 archived key identifies Option C (Encroaching public spaces) as correct under Reading Comprehension.,Hard,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2017 Tier 2 (2018-02-20 Shift 3 (Evening)),https://sscportal.in/cgl/tier-2/papers/english-language-and-comprehension-20-feb-2018
