All of these) as correct under Reading Comprehension.,Hard,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2017 Tier 2 (2018-02-21 Shift 3 (Evening)),https://sscportal.in/cgl/tier-2/papers/english-language-and-comprehension-21-feb-2018
