SSC-CGL-2018-T2-EN-EN-07479,SSC CGL,2018,Tier 2,2019-09-12,Shift 3 (Evening),English Comprehension,Direct & Indirect Speech,English,"Select the most appropriate indirect form of the given sentence. Major Chaudhry said to the aspirants, “Does everyone understand English?”",Major Chaudhry informed the aspirants that everyone understood English.,Major Chaudhry asked the aspirants whether everyone understood English.,Major Chaudhry told the aspirants that everyone should understand English.,Major Chaudhry asked the aspirants whether everyone understands English.,B,Major Chaudhry asked the aspirants whether everyone understood English.,Official SSC CGL 2018 Tier 2 response sheet highlights Option B (Major Chaudhry asked the aspirants whether everyone understood English.) as the official answer under Direct & Indirect Speech.,Hard,Verified,Verified (Official Response Sheet Key),2018 Tier 2 (2019-09-12 Shift 3 (Evening)),https://sscportal.in/sites/default/files/download-cgl-tier-2-papers-english-language-and-comprehension-12-sep-2019-evening-shift.pdf
