SSC-CGL-2022-T1-QA-EN-11985,SSC CGL,2022,Tier 1,2022-12-01,Shift 1,Quantitative Aptitude,Trigonometry & Heights,English,Simplify cos 45° / (sec 30° + cosec 30°),(3√2 + √6)/8,√3/(2√2 − 2√6),√3/(2√6 − 2√2),(3√2 − √6)/8,D,(3√2 − √6)/8,"cos 45° = 1/√2, sec 30° = 2/√3, cosec 30° = 2. Expression = (1/√2) ÷ (2/√3 + 2) = √3 / [2√2(1 + √3)]. Multiply by (√3 − 1)/(√3 − 1): √3(√3 − 1)/(2√2 × 2) = (3 − √3)/(4√2) = (3√2 − √6)/8. Answer: (3√2 − √6)/8",Medium,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2022 Tier 1 (2022-12-01 Shift 1),https://www.nextgenpsc.com/ssc/cgl/previous-year-papers/cgl-2022-12-01-s1
