SSC-CGL-2022-T1-GI-EN-12452,SSC CGL,2022,Tier 1,2022-12-13,Shift 1,General Intelligence & Reasoning,Blood Relations,English,"A # B means 'A is the sister of B'. A @ B means 'A is the son of B'. A & B means 'A is the father of B'. A % B means 'A is the mother of B'. If W & Q # T & Y @ M % K, then how is Q related to K?",Sister,Grandmother,Mother’s sister,Father’s sister,D,Father’s sister,"T & Y: T is the father of Y. Y @ M: Y is the son of M, so M is T’s wife. M % K: M is the mother of K, so K is T’s child too. Q # T: Q is the sister of T, i.e. the sister of K’s father — K’s paternal aunt (bua). Answer: Father’s sister",Medium,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2022 Tier 1 (2022-12-13 Shift 1),https://www.nextgenpsc.com/ssc/cgl/previous-year-papers/cgl-2022-12-13-s1
