SSC-CGL-2022-T1-GI-EN-12541,SSC CGL,2022,Tier 1,2022-12-13,Shift 4,General Intelligence & Reasoning,Blood Relations,English,"U $ V means 'U is the sister of V' U @ V means 'U is the husband of V' U * V means 'U is the son of V' U ÷ V means 'U is the mother of V' If O $ P * B @ F, then how is O related to F?",Daughter,Sister,Brother,Daughter-in-law,A,Daughter,"O $ P: O is the sister of P. P * B: P is the son of B. B @ F: B is the husband of F, so F is P’s mother. O is P’s sister, so O is F’s daughter. Answer: Daughter",Medium,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2022 Tier 1 (2022-12-13 Shift 4),https://www.nextgenpsc.com/ssc/cgl/previous-year-papers/cgl-2022-12-13-s4
