SSC-CGL-2024-T1-GI-EN-18870,SSC CGL,2024,Tier 1,2024-09-24,Shift 2,General Intelligence & Reasoning,Coding and decoding / alphabet-position sum,English,"IFF and ARB each encode to 21. Using the same rule, what number encodes CAW?",23,26,27,25,C,27,"The code adds alphabet positions: C = 3, A = 1, W = 23. Total = 3 + 1 + 23 = 27. IFF and ARB also total 21 under this rule.",Easy,Verified,Verified (Cross-Checked PYQ Archive),2024 Tier 1 (2024-09-24 Shift 2),https://www.nextgenpsc.com/ssc/cgl/previous-year-papers/cgl-2024-09-24-s2
