SSC-CGL-2024-T1-GA-EN-19091,SSC CGL,2024,Tier 1,2024-09-25,Shift 1,General Awareness,Biology,English,Match the points under Column A with those under Column B. Column A (Disease) Column B (Organism Responsible) i. Malaria a. Vibrio ii. Diarrhoea b. Salmonella iii. Typhoid c. Rotavirus iv. Cholera d. Plasmodium,"i-a, ii-c, iii-b, iv-d","i-b, ii-a, iii-c, iv-d","i-a, ii-b, iii-c, iv-d","i-d, ii-c, iii-b, iv-a",D,"i-d, ii-c, iii-b, iv-a","Malaria is caused by the protozoan Plasmodium (i-d); rotavirus is a leading cause of diarrhoea in children (ii-c). Typhoid is caused by Salmonella Typhi (iii-b) and cholera by Vibrio cholerae (iv-a). Answer: i-d, ii-c, iii-b, iv-a",Medium,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2024 Tier 1 (2024-09-25 Shift 1),https://www.nextgenpsc.com/ssc/cgl/previous-year-papers/cgl-2024-09-25-s1
SSC-CGL-2024-T1-GA-EN-19092,SSC CGL,2024,Tier 1,2024-09-25,Shift 1,General Awareness,Current Affairs & Schemes,English,Study the given table and answer the question. The table displays the number of cars produced (in lakhs) by six different brands between 2018 and 2023. Type 2018 2019 2000 2021 2022 2023 A 36 40 42 45 47 42 B 23 37 28 32 34 26 C 45 47 51 54 56 48 D 35 37 42 32 36 28 E 57 56 52 38 48 42 F 43 45 56 41 52 40 Find the difference in the average production of B and D during 2018-2023.,5.5 lakhs,4 lakhs,6 lakhs,5 lakhs,D,5 lakhs,"B: 23 + 37 + 28 + 32 + 34 + 26 = 180, average 30 lakh. D: 35 + 37 + 42 + 32 + 36 + 28 = 210, average 35 lakh. Difference = 35 − 30 = 5 lakh. (The third column, printed “2000” in the paper, is the year 2020.) Answer: 5 lakhs",Hard,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2024 Tier 1 (2024-09-25 Shift 1),https://www.nextgenpsc.com/ssc/cgl/previous-year-papers/cgl-2024-09-25-s1
SSC-CGL-2024-T1-GA-EN-19093,SSC CGL,2024,Tier 1,2024-09-25,Shift 1,General Awareness,General Knowledge,English,"If a 3 + 1/a 3 = 2 (a > 0), then the value of a + 1/a is:",3,1,4,2,D,2,"Let x = a + 1/a. Then a³ + 1/a³ = x³ − 3x, so x³ − 3x = 2, i.e. (x − 2)(x + 1)² = 0. Since a > 0, x = a + 1/a ≥ 2, so x = 2 (indeed a = 1). Answer: 2",Easy,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2024 Tier 1 (2024-09-25 Shift 1),https://www.nextgenpsc.com/ssc/cgl/previous-year-papers/cgl-2024-09-25-s1
