SSC-CGL-2024-T1-GA-EN-19095,SSC CGL,2024,Tier 1,2024-09-25,Shift 1,General Awareness,General Knowledge,English,9 ÷ [1 + {4 × (5/6 − 1/3 + 1/2 )}] is equal to:,9,0,1,9/5,A,9,"The bar (vinculum) is solved first: 1/3 + 1/2 = 5/6. So 5/6 − 5/6 = 0, the braces give 4 × 0 = 0, and 9 ÷ [1 + 0] = 9. Answer: 9",Easy,Verified,Verified (Archived Official Key),2024 Tier 1 (2024-09-25 Shift 1),https://www.nextgenpsc.com/ssc/cgl/previous-year-papers/cgl-2024-09-25-s1
