SSC-CGL-2025-T1-EN-EN-20651,SSC CGL,2025,Tier 1,2025-09-13,Shift 2,English Comprehension,Antonyms,English,Select the most appropriate antonym of the given word. Lachrymose,Tearful,Mournful,Weepy,Jovial,D,Jovial,Lachrymose means tearful or mournful. Its opposite is jovial (cheerful).,Easy,Verified,Verified (Official Response Sheet Key),2025 Tier 1 (2025-09-13 Shift 2),https://www.bookofexams.in/pyp/ssc-cgl/ssc-cgl-2025-tier-1-question-paper-13-september-shift-2/
