SSC-CGL-2025-T1-EN-EN-20653,SSC CGL,2025,Tier 1,2025-09-13,Shift 2,English Comprehension,Spelling Correction,English,Spot the correct spelling of an electron-transport protein.,Cytocrome,Cytocrhome,Cytochrome,Cytohrome,C,Cytochrome,Cytochrome is the correct spelling of the electron-transport haem protein.,Easy,Verified,Verified (Official Response Sheet Key),2025 Tier 1 (2025-09-13 Shift 2),https://www.bookofexams.in/pyp/ssc-cgl/ssc-cgl-2025-tier-1-question-paper-13-september-shift-2/
