SSC-CGL-2025-T1-EN-EN-20763,SSC CGL,2025,Tier 1,2025-09-14,Shift 1,English Comprehension,English Grammar & Vocabulary,English,What major issue plagued India’s Olympic performance post-1980?,Limited fan interest,Over-dependence on cricket,Systemic inefficiencies in sports,Lack of global tournaments,C,Systemic inefficiencies in sports,"After 1980 the drought exposed “systemic inefficiencies: lack of infrastructure, inadequate training, and minimal grassroots scouting”.",Medium,Verified,Verified (Official Response Sheet Key),2025 Tier 1 (2025-09-14 Shift 1),https://www.bookofexams.in/pyp/ssc-cgl/ssc-cgl-2025-tier-1-question-paper-14-september-shift-1/
