SSC-CGL-2025-T1-GA-EN-20790,SSC CGL,2025,Tier 1,2025-09-14,Shift 1,General Awareness,General Knowledge,English,Read the below statements marked as Assertion (A) and Reason (R). Mark the correct options: Assertion (A): The National Green Hydrogen Mission aims to reduce dependency on fossil fuels. Reason (R): It is implemented by MoEFCC.,"Both A and R are true, and R is the correct explanation of A","Both A and R are true, but R is not the correct explanation of A","A is true, but R is false","A is false, but R is true",C,"A is true, but R is false","The National Green Hydrogen Mission aims to cut dependence on fossil fuels, so A is true. It is run by the Ministry of New and Renewable Energy, not MoEFCC, so R is false.",Hard,Verified,Verified (Official Response Sheet Key),2025 Tier 1 (2025-09-14 Shift 1),https://www.bookofexams.in/pyp/ssc-cgl/ssc-cgl-2025-tier-1-question-paper-14-september-shift-1/
