SSC-CGL-2025-T1-GI-EN-20801,SSC CGL,2025,Tier 1,2025-09-14,Shift 1,General Intelligence & Reasoning,Alphabetical & Letter Series,English,"Select the letter-cluster from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series. JKL, MNO, PQR, ?",SFD,BHF,STU,DTG,C,STU,"Each group is the next three consecutive letters: JKL, MNO, PQR, STU.",Medium,Verified,Verified (Official Response Sheet Key),2025 Tier 1 (2025-09-14 Shift 1),https://www.bookofexams.in/pyp/ssc-cgl/ssc-cgl-2025-tier-1-question-paper-14-september-shift-1/
